      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Alright",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Because the sentence was delivered a little out of context, please make another recording and say it this way: Ana m efunahụ ego mgbe niile, ọ dị m ka ihe adịghị mma na egwuregwu a",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please re-record the introduction because the previous version included something outside the supplied text. The required wording is:\n\"One person wrote to me, такое сообщение\" (starts to read the сообщение с телефон):\n\"I'm constantly losing, it seems to me that something is wrong with the game\"\nAna m efunahụ ego mgbe niile, ọ dị m ka ihe adịghị mma na egwuregwu a",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Would it be possible to move it to next Friday?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hello",
        "milestone": null
