      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Attached is the corrected copy for your review.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 19,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please make another recording. At the beginning, the translation or delivery of “Ana m efunahụ ego mgbe niile, ọ dị m ka ihe adịghị mma na egwuregwu a!” was a little poor. It is very important that you read this message correctly from the phone, while everything else must be said exactly according to the script.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 20,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Hello)",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 21,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The revised copy is here.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 22,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Please note that once the script is translated into Igbo, its wording runs longer than 90-120secs, so the exact game actions cannot all be read within that duration.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 23,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Open with the actor saying:\n\"Someone sent me a message.\" (The actor begins reading the message from the phone.)\n\"I keep losing all the time. It feels like something is wrong with the game.\" — Ana m efunahụ ego mgbe niile, ọ dị m ka ihe adịghị mma na egwuregwu a!\n(Ana m efunahụ ego mgbe niile, ọ dị m ka ihe adịghị mma na egwuregwu a! — translation of the message.)\nThe actor then replies:\n\"Most likely, you downloaded a fake version where it’s impossible to win!\nLet me demonstrate what the fake version looks like.\nWe’ll play this one first.\nThe graphics seem strange.\nThere, we played and lost immediately, right?\nThat is the fake version.\nNext, let’s open the real app.\nWe’ll play here for a little while.\nI’ve already placed my bet at €35, okay?\nNotice that the graphics are different here.\nFour more steps... great.\n€2,480.\nI personally controlled every step.\nNow let’s withdraw the money.\nWe’ll wait a moment for the winning confirmation to appear here.\nThe money is already in my account.\nLook, my banking app has already sent a notification.\nThat’s everything.\nSee?\nThe entire process took 12 minutes.\nIt really is that simple.\nThis is why many people lose their money: they play through fake apps.\nUse the link below the video to download only the official app and earn money just as I do.\"",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 24,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please use the script provided here as your guide, because the video opening was wrong again. Start with this wording, read it carefully, and say it exactly as written.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 25,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "It’s the introduction script that you keep changing.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 26,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The line you sent now differs from the first line shown here.",
        "milestone": null
      },
